WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.917
Views of the gym show red mats, a tumble track, and an overhead rig.

00:03.917 --> 00:07.333
An athlete does a pull-up. Two gymnasts tumble on the track and floor.

00:07.333 --> 00:11.500
A gymnast moves across the floor. Another holds their legs wide on low handstand bars.

00:11.500 --> 00:13.625
An athlete climbs the rig. Another swings a kettlebell.

00:13.625 --> 00:16.000
A gymnast lifts from a wide-legged position into a handstand.

00:16.000 --> 00:19.167
An athlete plants near a cone and pushes away. Another runs past an indicator light.

00:19.167 --> 00:24.000
Athletes cross a cargo net and climb on holds above mats.
